    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17256" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex-stillo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ext-</span></b> ), āvi, 1, v. n.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to drop</i> or
				<i>trickle out</i> (very rare; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">not in Cic.): amurca exstillat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					12, 50, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sinapis, oculi ut exstillent, facit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Ps. 3, 2, 29</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lacrumis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ter.
					Phorm. 5, 7, 82</span></i>
			.</div>
